(blueprint-diff "/Game/ThirdPerson/Blueprints/BP_ThirdPersonCharacter"
  (old (revision "b919fcf9") (date "2026-11-11T02:39:54.000Z") (description "Pick up a weapon by walking into it\n\n- BP_Weapon_Base: a Capsule on the Weapon mesh replaces the Sphere as\n  the pickup hitbox; the Weapon mesh overlaps every channel, is turned\n  90 degrees and shows aid-cane.\n- BP_Weapons_Sword: sword_B with its own capsule size and position; its\n  Weapon mesh blocks every channel.\n- BP_ThirdPersonCharacter: on Actor Begin Overlap, a BP_Weapon_Base is\n  attached to the Mesh at the HandGrip_R socket.\n- Doc/commits/20261111_033942: documentation of this step.\n- AGENTS.md: \"commit and push\" also finishes the transient doc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"))
